{"id":"1e2b0ebca4f5fffb","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-turing-progress.md","title":"Turing Progress Theorem","display":"thm-turing-progress — Turing Progress Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-turing-progress","aliases":["92-thm-turing-progress"],"display":"thm-turing-progress — Turing Progress Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-thm-deduction-theorem]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]"],"source":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展","source_status":"原书之外的证明论扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-turing-progress"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-turing-progress</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-turing-progress — Turing Progress Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3886f8e5c8d0f18\" href=\"?note=e3886f8e5c8d0f18\" title=\"92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy\">92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a5543a92447a0293\" href=\"?note=a5543a92447a0293\" title=\"92-thm-deduction-theorem\">92-thm-deduction-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的证明论扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (the fixed PA system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (the internal consistency sentence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\">\\(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\)</span> (one-step consistency extension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a5543a92447a0293\" href=\"?note=a5543a92447a0293\" title=\"92-thm-deduction-theorem\">92-thm-deduction-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}\\)</span> (theorem-set constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}progress}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{Th}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\land G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}progress}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{Th}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\land G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里给出固定系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的一步Turing进展：只扩张公理分量，避免把形式系统三元组写成集合并</li>\n<li>严格性来自第二不完备性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>，而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^+\">\\(G^+\\)</span>把它作为公理，因此其定理集严格包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li>本断言没有声称<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^+\">\\(G^+\\)</span>仍相容；继续迭代需要逐层外部相容性或可靠性论证</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中由相容性保证不可证，但未必连其否定也不可证；所以不能无附加假设把每一步新增句都称为“独立句”</li>\n<li>超限Turing进程还需要序数记号系统、基本序列或极限阶段取并规则；一步定理本身不自动产生完整序数层级</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e3886f8e5c8d0f18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-deduction-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a5543a92447a0293","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-deduction-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-deduction-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a5543a92447a0293","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]$ (one-step consistency extension, see [[92-thm-deduction-theorem]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Th}$ (theorem-set constructor, see [[92-df-theory-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}progress}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{Th}\\bigl(G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\bigr)\n\\land G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\land G[\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\}]\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1919,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-turing-progress]]"}],"outgoing":["e3886f8e5c8d0f18","68f172d58c15e75d","c7befd96bd551ade","e0eabee5d77258a7","975b3aa9a1e08797","a5543a92447a0293","57ea3ea286817df3"]}